 46- 49   A4     ppm^2/uHz E_log_alpha_0  Upper uncertainty on log_alpha_0
 51- 55   A5     uHz    nu_char        Average characteristic frequency
 57- 61   A5     uHz    e_nu_char      Lower uncertainty on nu_char
 63- 67   A5     uHz    E_nu_char      Upper uncertainty on nu_char
 69- 72   A4     ---    gamma          Average slope of Stochastic low-frequency
                                    variability in power density
 74- 77   A4     ---    e_gamma        Lower uncertainty in gamma
 79- 82   A4     ---    E_gamma        Upper uncertainty in gamma
 84- 87   A4     ppm^2/uHz log_Cw         Average log10 of white noise in power
                                    density
 89- 92   A4     ppm^2/uHz e_log_Cw       Lower uncertainty on log_Cw
