                                    variability of light curve
104-107   A4     ppm    e_log_RMS      Lower uncertainty on log_RMS
109-112   A4     ppm    E_log_RMS      Upper uncertainty on log_RMS
114-119   A6     uHz    nu_50          Average frequency at 0.5 cumulative
                                    integrated power density
121-126   A6     uHz    e_nu_50        Lower uncertainty on nu_50
